    refactor(tui): externalize TUI stylesheet to isycode.tcss (ported from Kilo PR #9)
    
    Moves the ~205-line inline CSS attribute to src/isycode/isycode.tcss
    via Textual's CSS_PATH idiom (absolute, cwd-independent), includes
    *.tcss in package-data, and adds Kilo's test verifying the external
    stylesheet is packaged and applied. Ported from Kilo PR #9 onto current
    main; their tomllib fallback (already fixed), setup.py/MANIFEST.in
    cruft and old-baseline type hints were dropped.

